  "reading": [
    "RB+G shows a large positive effect on concepts with polarity conflict (metformin, berberine, luna) and a HONEST null on pure structural concepts (windows_os, linux).",
    "atorvastatin (mono-directional) fissions but recall gain is null — honest, showing RB+G is not a free-lunch amplifier.",
    "ABLATE_CAP: cascade fires 3-4× more fissions without accuracy benefit; the generation cap is a computational necessity, not an accuracy win.",
    "ABLATE_FANOUT: without 1/√2 fan-out the raw peak is inflated because injected energy doubles; the fan-out is required for HONEST measurement.",
    "ABLATE_ALIAS: cannot be cleanly ablated (probe semantics change); documented confound.",
    "ABLATE_BIND: the learned binding spring provides only marginal accuracy improvement over no coupling — evidence that RB's fiat k=2.5 was over-fitted; a soft coordination is enough."
  ]
